method('cycle',p('SBR週期與處理量','SBR cycle and throughput'),p('序批式反應槽用時間切換充填、反應、沉澱與排水；週期變長會降低每天可完成批次。','An SBR separates fill, reaction, settling and decant in time; a longer cycle reduces daily batch capacity.'),p('每批排水V=200 m³、週期6 h、槽數2','decant volumeV=200 m³ per batch,6 h cycle and2 tanks'),'Qday=V(24/tcycle)N','200*(24/6)*2','m³/d',p('穩定批次理想排程，未含備援停機及進水暫存。','Ideal steady batch schedule; redundancy downtime and influent equalization excluded.'),p('在時間軸排列兩槽狀態，查進水高峰時是否仍有接收容積。','Schedule both tanks on a timeline and check receiving capacity during influent peaks.'),p('只縮短沉澱以增加批次可能使污泥隨排水流失。','Shortening settling solely to add batches may wash out solids during decant.'),p('批次數增加一定不影響出水品質。','More batches never affect effluent quality.'),p('只把週期改成8 h','change only cycle time to8 h'),'200*(24/8)*2')
method('decant',p('排水器下降速度','Decanter lowering rate'),p('排水降低液面；排水速率與水面面積決定下降速度，須與污泥層間距一起觀察。','Decanting lowers the surface; flow and surface area set its lowering rate, which must be observed with clearance above the sludge blanket.'),p('排水Q=120 m³/h、表面積A=200 m²','decantQ=120 m³/h and surface areaA=200 m²'),'vlevel=Q/A','120/200','m/h',p('均勻水面與定截面近似，非排水器型號允許值。','Uniform surface and constant-section approximation, not a decanter product limit.'),p('重播液位與泥層高度，檢查排水末段濁度。','Replay liquid and blanket levels and inspect late-decant turbidity.'),p('泥層上浮或液位感測錯誤可使排水器吸入污泥。','Rising sludge or level-sensor error can make a decanter entrain solids.'),p('只要排水量正確就可以忽略泥層位置。','Correct decant volume makes sludge-blanket position irrelevant.'),p('只把排水Q改成80 m³/h','change only decantQ to80 m³/h'),'80/200')
method('duty',p('間歇曝氣與有效運轉','Intermittent aeration and duty'),p('每週期曝氣時間決定每日運轉時數；同平均能耗可能對應不同峰值供氧能力。','Aeration time per cycle sets daily operating hours; equal average energy can conceal different peak transfer capacity.'),p('曝氣器功率20 kW、每天曝氣12 h','aerator power20 kW and12 aerated hours per day'),'E=P ton','20*12','kWh/d',p('固定輸入功率示範，不等於氧需求或曝氣策略最佳化。','Fixed-input-power example, not oxygen demand or optimized control.'),p('在週期圖分開記錄曝氣、攪拌、沉澱的電表與狀態。','Log power and states separately for aeration, mixing and settling on the cycle timeline.'),p('沉澱時曝氣誤開會破壞分離，不只多耗電。','Accidental aeration during settling disrupts separation as well as wasting energy.'),p('不同曝氣排程只要總電量相同效果就相同。','Different aeration schedules have identical effects at equal total energy.'),p('只把每天曝氣時數改成15 h','change only aerated time to15 h'),'20*15')
method('carrier',p('載體保護面積與填充率','Carrier protected area and fill fraction'),p('MBBR有效面積由反應槽容積、載體填充率及載體保護比表面積相乘；不能把槽壁面積當生物膜面積。','MBBR area is reactor volume times carrier fill and protected specific area; reactor-wall area is not the biofilm area.'),p('槽容V=100 m³、填充f=0.50、載體保護面積a=400 m²/m³載體','reactorV=100 m³, fillf=0.50 and protected areaa=400 m²/m³ carrier'),'A=Vfa','100*0.50*400','m²',p('假想幾何值，實際可用生物面積仍受堵塞與膜厚影響。','Hypothetical geometry; usable biological area also depends on clogging and film thickness.'),p('依載體資料確認面積定義，盤點裝填量並觀察是否均勻翻動。','Check the area definition in carrier data, inventory media and observe uniform movement.'),p('過高填充可能降低混合並增加攔網負擔。','Excess fill can reduce mixing and overload retention screens.'),p('填充越滿就一定能無限制提高處理能力。','More fill increases treatment capacity without limit.'),p('只把填充f降成0.40','reduce only fillf to0.40'),'100*0.40*400')
method('surface',p('生物膜表面負荷','Biofilm surface loading'),p('附著生長系統以每天負荷除以可用面積評估負擔；有機物與氨氮必須分開計算。','Attached-growth loading is daily load divided by usable area; organic matter and ammonia must be accounted for separately.'),p('有機負荷60 kg/d、可用生物面積20000 m²','organic load60 kg/d and usable biological area20000 m²'),'LA=1000L/A','1000*60/20000','g/(m²·d)',p('假想平均表面負荷，未計溫度、氧限制與生物膜動力學。','Hypothetical mean surface load; temperature, oxygen limitation and kinetics excluded.'),p('量測進出水負荷並將其與載體面積和水溫一起報告。','Measure influent/effluent loads and report them alongside carrier area and water temperature.'),p('外層異營菌搶氧可使同面積硝化能力下降。','Outer heterotrophs can consume oxygen and reduce nitrification at the same area.'),p('所有污染物都可用同一表面負荷限值處理。','One surface-loading limit applies to every pollutant.'),p('只把有機負荷改成90 kg/d','change only organic load to90 kg/d'),'1000*90/20000')
method('diffusion',p('生物膜擴散距離','Biofilm diffusion length'),p('擴散特徵時間與膜厚平方成正比；生物膜加厚會增加質傳時間，不必然增加有效反應量。','Characteristic diffusion time scales with thickness squared; a thicker film lengthens transport and need not increase effective reaction.'),p('膜厚L=0.0005 m、有效擴散係數D=1e-9 m²/s','film thicknessL=0.0005 m and effective diffusivityD=1e-9 m²/s'),'tdiff=L²/D','0.0005**2/1e-9','s',p('無反應的量級估計；反應—擴散與孔隙結構需更完整模型。','Nonreactive timescale estimate; reaction-diffusion and porosity need a fuller model.'),p('比較膜厚、溶氧剖面與表面負荷，不能僅稱量載體。','Compare thickness, oxygen profiles and surface loading rather than carrier mass alone.'),p('厚膜內層缺氧與脫落會讓出水SS升高。','Oxygen-poor thick inner layers and sloughing can raise effluent SS.'),p('生物膜厚度加倍就必定處理量加倍。','Doubling biofilm thickness necessarily doubles treatment.'),p('只把膜厚減成0.00025 m','reduce only film thickness to0.00025 m'),'0.00025**2/1e-9')
method('screen',p('載體攔網的淨通水面積','Carrier-screen clear flow area'),p('攔網需保留載體又讓水通過；開孔率與堵塞決定淨面積，並影響局部水頭損失。','Retention screens hold media while passing water; open fraction and blockage determine clear area and local head loss.'),p('總面積2 m²、開孔率0.50、堵塞分率0.20','gross area2 m², open fraction0.50 and blockage fraction0.20'),'Aclear=Agross fopen(1-fblocked)','2*0.50*(1-0.20)','m²',p('幾何估計，水頭損失需依網孔及流況另估。','Geometric estimate; head loss requires aperture and flow information.'),p('核對上下游水位與流量，拍攝堵塞範圍並觀察載體流失。','Check upstream/downstream levels and flow, document blockage and observe media loss.'),p('攔網破損會流失載體，堵塞則可能造成溢流。','A damaged screen loses carriers while blockage can cause overflow.'),p('攔網只要總面積夠大就不受堵塞影響。','Large gross screen area makes blockage irrelevant.'),p('只把堵塞分率增加到0.50','increase only blockage to0.50'),'2*0.50*(1-0.50)')
method('trickling',p('濾床水力負荷與布水','Trickling-filter hydraulic loading'),p('生物濾池需把液體分配到填料表面，回流可改善潤濕但增加水力負荷；過濕會降低通風。','A trickling filter distributes liquid over media; recycle improves wetting but raises hydraulic loading, and excessive wetness restricts ventilation.'),p('進水1000、回流500 m³/d、濾床面積250 m²','influent1000 and recycle500 m³/d with bed area250 m²'),'HL=(Q+Qr)/A','(1000+500)/250','m/d',p('平均布水量，不能描述局部乾區或噴嘴失效。','Mean loading; local dry areas and nozzle failure are not resolved.'),p('比較接水杯的分布均勻度、噴臂速度與床底通風。','Compare catch-cup distribution, distributor speed and underdrain ventilation.'),p('布水孔堵塞會讓部分填料乾燥而其他區域積水。','Clogged nozzles dry some media while flooding others.'),p('總進水量正常就保證每個填料面都被均勻潤濕。','Normal total flow guarantees uniformly wetted media.'),p('只把回流增加到1000 m³/d','increase only recycle to1000 m³/d'),'(1000+1000)/250')

